@startuml stroke_network_generation
title Stroke network - generation

skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true

actor "User" as U
participant "Generator" as G
participant "Network" as N #E6E0FA
participant "Builder" as B

U -> G : Task, seed

== Autoregressive stroke sampling ==
loop for each stroke (target = next waypoint)
  G -> G : Express waypoints relative to the start
  G -> N : Conditioning and previous\ngenerated stroke
  alt deterministic
    N -> N : Mean of the highest-weight component
  else stochastic
    N -> N : Pick a mixture component,\nsample its Gaussian
  end
  N --> G : Stroke parameters (standardized)
  G -> G : De-standardize, check values, advance
end

== Trajectory construction ==
G -> B : Stroke sequence
B -> B : Amplitude of each stroke = Bézier arc length
B -> B : Sum lognormal speed profiles over time
B -> B : Travelled distance S(t) = sum_k D_k Phi_k(t)\n(Phi_k = lognormal CDF of stroke k)
B -> B : S(t) => Bézier segment reached\nand point at that arc length
B --> U : Trajectory + speed profile
@enduml